Thus many goals need to be achieved.

We need to produce a plan achieving all these.

We have many actions defined. Let's examine the domain to understand the workflow.

We have candidate entities: origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha, shift_candidate_alpha, shift_candidate_beta.

We have actions:

- create_candidate (creates candidate_created)
- allocate_vehicle_unit (requires candidate_created, not vehicle_allocated, vehicle_available) -> vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, not vehicle_available.
- attach_task_profile (requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, route_task_profile_available) -> candidate_task_profile_linked, not route_task_profile_available.
- confirm_candidate_preparedness (requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked, not candidate_prepared) -> candidate_prepared.
- detach_task_profile (requires candidate_task_profile_linked) -> route_task_profile_available, not candidate_task_profile_linked.
- assign_operator_resource (requires candidate_prepared, operator_available) -> candidate_operator_linked, not operator_available.
- release_operator_resource (requires candidate_operator_linked) -> operator_available, not candidate_operator_linked.
- assign_skill_certificate (requires candidate_prepared, skill_certificate_available) -> candidate_skill_certificate_linked, not skill_certificate_available.
- release_skill_certificate (requires candidate_skill_certificate_linked) -> skill_certificate_available, not candidate_skill_certificate_linked.
- assign_compliance_certificate (requires candidate_prepared, compliance_certificate_available) -> candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, not compliance_certificate_available.
- release_compliance_certificate (requires candidate_compliance_certificate_linked) -> compliance_certificate_available, not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked.
- activate_origin_node (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, not origin_node_ready, not origin_node_occupied) -> origin_node_ready.
- lock_origin_availability (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, not origin_availability_locked) -> origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed.
- load_origin_payload (requires candidate_prepared, origin_availability_node_linked, cargo_available, not origin_availability_locked) -> origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, not cargo_available.
- unload_origin_payload (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, origin_node_occupied, origin_payload_linked, not origin_availability_confirmed) -> origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, not origin_payload_linked.
- activate_destination_node (similar for destination).
- lock_destination_availability (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, destination_node_ready, not destination_availability_locked) -> destination_availability_locked, destination_availability_confirmed.
- load_destination_payload (requires candidate_prepared, destination_availability_node_linked, cargo_available, not destination_availability_locked) -> destination_node_occupied, destination_availability_locked, destination_payload_linked, not cargo_available.
- unload_destination_payload (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, destination_node_occupied, destination_payload_linked, not destination_availability_confirmed) -> destination_node_ready, destination_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, not destination_payload_linked.
- assemble_transport_leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available) -> transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, not transport_leg_available.
- assemble_origin_loaded_leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_occupied, destination_node_ready, not origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available) -> transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, origin_leg_loaded, not transport_leg_available.
- assemble_destination_loaded_leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_occupied, origin_availability_confirmed, not destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available) -> transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, destination_leg_loaded, not transport_leg_available.
- assemble_fully_loaded_leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_occupied, destination_node_occupied, not origin_availability_confirmed, not destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available) -> transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, origin_leg_loaded, destination_leg_loaded, not transport_leg_available.
- authorize_transport_leg_loading (requires transport_leg_assembled, origin_availability_locked, candidate_task_profile_linked, not transport_leg_loading_authorized) -> transport_leg_loading_authorized.
- load_container_onto_leg (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_transport_leg_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_available, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not loading_container_loaded) -> loading_container_loaded, loading_container_leg_linked, not loading_container_available.
- stage_schedule_candidate (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_loading_container_linked, candidate_transport_leg_linked, loading_container, transport_leg, route_task_profile) -> candidate_staged_for_loading.
- verify_loading_profile_nominal (requires candidate_staged_for_loading, candidate_skill_certificate_linked, candidate_operator_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_loading_verified) -> candidate_loading_verified.
- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready (requires origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready) -> dispatch_ready.
- mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready (similar for destination).
- finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation (requires compliance_validation_complete, not candidate_finalized) -> candidate_finalized, dispatch_ready.
- verify_compliance_certificate (requires operator_alignment_confirmed, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, not compliance_validation_complete) -> compliance_validation_complete.
- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (requires dispatch_ready, candidate_task_profile_linked, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated) -> dispatch_allocated, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatch_slot_available.
- execute_origin_dispatch (requires dispatch_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatched) -> dispatched, vehicle_available, dispatch_slot_available.
- execute_destination_dispatch (similar for destination_availability).
- execute_schedule_dispatch (for schedule_candidate).
- release_operator_resource, release_skill_certificate, release_compliance_certificate, detach_task_profile.

Also there are actions for candidate_origin_availability_linked etc? Actually those are predicates, not actions. There are actions for linking? Not defined; they appear as predicates that are set by init? Actually there are predicates like candidate_origin_availability_linked, candidate_destination_availability_linked, candidate_transport_leg_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, candidate_operator_linked, candidate_skill_certificate_linked, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_task_profile_linked, candidate_operational_constraint_linked, candidate_service_window_linked? Not defined. There are also candidate_origin_availability_linked etc as predicates but no actions to set them? Wait there are actions like allocate_vehicle_unit sets candidate_vehicle_linked. attach_task_profile sets candidate_task_profile_linked. assign_operator_resource sets candidate_operator_linked. assign_skill_certificate sets candidate_skill_certificate_linked. assign_compliance_certificate sets candidate_compliance_certificate_linked. There are also actions for linking origin/destination availability? Actually there are predicates candidate_origin_availability_linked and candidate_destination_availability_linked but no actions to set them? They appear in init as true for shift_candidate_alpha and shift_candidate_beta linked to origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha. So they are already set initially. Similarly candidate_transport_leg_linked is set for both shift candidates to transport_leg_alpha. candidate_loading_container_linked set for shift_candidate_alpha to loading_container_alpha and shift_candidate_beta to loading_container_beta. So those are already true.

